:: 3.1. A Doing Here [nobr agent] {"position":"250,1850","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "3.1.ADoingHere">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Existential. Not practical. You're introducing thoughts that weren't there before.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Who or what brought me here? I don't exactly remember my past, but I am sure it didn't include a place like this.|3.1. B Who Brought]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



:: 3.1. A Environment [nobr agent] {"position":"175,1975","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "3.1.AEnvironment">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Life and death are phases of existence. Death isn't the end. We only ever die when away from our home. Our world wouldn't be accommodating for you. This is like emulating a small Earth while orbiting it.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "You">>
        Thanks..?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Continue into the hallway.|Hallway Convergence]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



:: 3.1. A Escaped [nobr agent] {"position":"375,1850","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "3.1.AEscaped">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Escaped. Escaping what? You don't look escaped.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Who or what brought me here? I don't exactly remember my past, but I am sure it didn't include a place like this.|3.1. B Who Brought]]
[[What is that even supposed to mean? So you capture me or trade me or whatever you did to me and now you don't even question how I got out of that thing?|3.1. C Trade]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



:: 3.1. A Obsessed [agent nobr] {"position":"75,1750","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "3.1.AObsessed">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Intent isn't specific to your world. The focus is. If the environment aligns, intent doesn't need to come first.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Are all aliens this philosophical?|3.1. A Philosophical]]
            [[What kind of environment do you guys even live in for you to think so drastically differently from us humans or any other lifeform on Earth?|3.1. A Environment]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



