<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "3.1.APhilosophical">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Yes. Others are present here as well. Their respective research rooms branch off after the end of the hallway.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Continue into the hallway.|Hallway Convergence]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



:: 3.1. Actually Human [nobr agent] {"position":"750,2025","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "3.1.ActuallyHuman">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        The voice speaks only when it hears... I think it doesn't hear me.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Where do I go from here?|3.1. Where Go]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



:: 3.1. Also Hear [nobr agent] {"position":"750,1900","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "3.1.AlsoHear">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        What I detect is closer to the opposite — an active signal projecting itself through the vessel's systems, carried in part by the component installed in your skull. The voice speaks without hearing.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[What has the voice been saying?|3.1. Voice Saying]]
            [[Do you mean it just sounds human or is it an actual human saying it?|3.1. Actually Human]]
            [[Where do I go from here?|3.1. Where Go]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



:: 3.1. B Who Brought [nobr agent] {"position":"350,1975","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "3.1.BWhoBrought">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        You were bought. A simple trade of currency for biomass. Why does the concept of 'will' change the math for you? What did you expect instead?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[What do you mean by that? Didn't you just say I was sold into your hands and against my will?|3.1. Sold Against Will]]
            [[I want you to bring me back to Earth.|3.1. Back to Earth]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



:: 3.1. Back to Earth [nobr agent] {"position":"475,2125","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "3.1.BackToEarth">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Precautionary measures aren't yet taken. The research could end if not given time... Why do you want to go?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[And what the hell do you want me to do up here then? You still haven't answered what you want from me.|3.1. What Do You Want]]
            [[You think I am not willing to fight back?|3.1. Fight Back]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



