    <<ctp "3.1.ChoiceVoice">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        The voice is more likely to be human. The voice is felt everywhere on the vessel and its agenda would point to philosophy. The intent is still unknown.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[How do you know it's a human voice?|3.1. Human Voice]]
