    <<ctp "3.1.WhatDoYouWant">>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        You're asking again. The connection didn't form. This vessel is a research centre. Your home is the subject. It was meant to be undisturbed. It isn't.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Walk away.|3.1. Walk Away]]
            [[Try to punch the alien.|3.1. Punch]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>> 
</div>



