        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        You're moving again. Good. Engineering is straight ahead.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        He didn't see. The device is in your hand. You continue down the hallway toward the engineering bay.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Continue to the Engineering bay.|Engineering Bay Entry]]
        </div>
