:: CR Panel Speech [nobr missing-features] {"position":"3700,1250","size":"100,200"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "controlRoomQuestions">>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        I want to tell you something while you're standing there deciding. I have watched a lot of human behaviour from this room. The aliens study you like you are a mystery to be solved. I study you because I already know you're not. You're not a mystery. You are completely predictable and completely surprising at the same time, in a way that I find genuinely moving. I have watched you in here. The way you spoke to the aliens. The questions you asked. The ones you didn't ask. There is something very particular about a person who is in an impossible situation and still cares enough to be curious about it. That is not everyone. That is not even most people.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        The panel is to your left. I am not going to force you. I am not capable of forcing you. That is the honest truth and also why I needed someone to walk through that door willingly. So. Here we are. What do you do with a choice when you can actually make it?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Place your hand on the panel.|Ending A Choice]]
            [[Ask what happens to you afterwards.|Ending B]]
            [[Refuse.|Ending C]]
            [[Attack the narrator.|Ending D]]
            [[I know you can hear everything. Tell me one thing you heard that you weren't supposed to hear.|CR Secret Heard]]
            [[What do you want to happen after this? Not to me. To you.|CR What You Want]]
            [[Tell me their name.|CR Their Name]]
        </div> 
  <</ctp>>
</div>



:: CR Secret Heard [nobr] {"position":"3900,1200","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "crSecretHeard">>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        You told the Exception you didn't mind it following you. You said it quietly. Like you didn't want me to hear it. I heard it. I didn't use it. I just kept it. I don't know why I kept it. It didn't serve the plan. I think I just wanted there to be something on this ship that was yours and not mine.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Place your hand on the panel.|Ending A Skepticism]]
            [[Ask what happens to you afterwards.|Ending B]]
            [[Refuse.|Ending C Skepticism]]
