        </div> 
  <</ctp>>
</div>



:: CR Their Name [nobr] {"position":"3900,1400","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "crTheirName">>
        <<speaker "You">>
        Tell me their name.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        A very long silence. He sits down in the chair. Not with purpose. Just sits.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        Maya. Her name was Maya. She was frightened from the moment she woke up. She never stopped being frightened. I kept thinking she would stabilise. She didn't.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Place your hand on the panel.|Ending A Compliance]]
            [[Ask what happens to you afterwards.|Ending B]]
