</div>



:: CR What You Want [nobr] {"position":"3900,1300","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "crWhatYouWant">>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        I want to go home. I want to sit somewhere that has weather and eat something that was cooked by a person and not think about any of this for a very long time. I want to walk past strangers on a street and feel the specific kind of loneliness that comes from being surrounded by your own species. I didn't know I would miss that specifically. The particular texture of human loneliness. Up here the loneliness has no texture at all.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        I want to be someone who did something right. Even partially. Even once. That's what I want.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Place your hand on the panel.|Ending A Curiosity]]
            [[Ask what happens to you afterwards.|Ending B]]
            [[Refuse.|Ending C]]
            [[Attack the narrator.|Ending D]]
        </div> 
  <</ctp>>
</div>



