    	<<speaker "Narrator">>
        No. They made that choice themselves, which I know is what someone responsible would also say. But I genuinely tried to help them in that situation, I couldn't have stopped it. Their brain got messed up from the biochip. I couldn't have known it would happen that fast. I'm not asking you to absolve me. I'm telling you what happened.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Return to the archive.|Archive Bay Entry]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>>
</div>



