:: Eng Artifact Use [nobr missing-features] {"position":"2200,1750","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "engArtifactUse">>
        <<speaker "Engineer">>
        A malfunction in specimen bay observation parameters would constitute a research irregularity. Reducing containment measures in the specimen bay could allow for more direct data acquisition. This is within acceptable research deviation.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
