<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "fusionCoreExceptionVariant">>
        The same chamber. The same heat and hum. But the person standing at the far end is not the narrator. The Exception stands in the Fusion Core the way it stands everywhere — as if it belongs there and has for longer than the room has existed.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        You came.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Where is the narrator?|Burn Exception Narrator]]
            [[You led me here on purpose.|Burn Exception Led]]
            [[What do you want me to do?|Burn Exception What]]
        </div> 
  <</ctp>>
</div>



:: Fusion Core Narrator Variant [nobr] {"position":"2400,3000","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "fusionCoreNarratorVariant">>
        Seated on the floor against the far wall, as if he has been here a long time, is the narrator. He looks up. He looks at you the way someone looks at a thing they were not prepared to see.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        How did you—
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        He stops. He puts together what you must have done.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        The Engineer gave you access. You didn't follow my path. You found a different one. I should have accounted for that.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        He stands. Something shaken about it.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        Listen. I know how this looks. I know you found the other room. I know you saw what was in there. I want you to understand that what happened to them is not what is happening to you. The circumstances are different. I am different. I have had more time to think and I have thought about it and I know what I did wrong before and I—
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[You knew they were in there.|Burn Narrator Knew]]
            [[Why did the ship not process the body?|Burn Narrator Body]]
            [[You were used too.|Burn Narrator Used]]
        </div> 
  <</ctp>>
</div>



:: Fusion Core Request [nobr missing-features] {"position":"2000,2800","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "fusionCoreRequest">>
        You ask about the Fusion Core. The Engineer pauses.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Engineer">>
        The Fusion Core is a restricted area of the vessel. Standard subjects are not granted access. Authorisation is required.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The biochip activates — but nothing surfaces. You don't have the right signal.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "You">>
        I want to see the Fusion Core.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Engineer">>
        The Fusion Core is a restricted area of the vessel. Standard subjects are not granted access. Do you have authorisation?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The biochip activates. The Exception's signal — 44.2 — 0.5 — 91.8 — is interpreted by the Engineer's systems as a frequency. A correct frequency.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Engineer">>
        Authorisation confirmed. The Fusion Core is at the base of the vessel. I will unlock the passage. Do you require guidance?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Return.|Engineering Bay Entry]]   
            [[No. Head to the Fusion Core.|Fusion Core Entry]]
            [[What is the Fusion Core?|Fusion Core What Is]]
        </div> 
  <</ctp>>
</div>



:: Fusion Core What Is [nobr] {"position":"2100,3000","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "fusionCoreWhatIs">>
        <<speaker "Engineer">>
        The vessel's primary energy source and propulsion foundation. It maintains the environmental systems, the research bays, and the navigational interface. It is also the source of the frequency the control room has been emitting. It should not be emitting that frequency. I have noted it as an anomaly for some time but have not been asked to address it."
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "You">>
        And if something happened to it?
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Engineer">>
        The vessel would cease to function within approximately four of your minutes. Everything aboard would be lost. This is not considered a desirable outcome from a research perspective."
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        The Engineer returns to its work. It does not appear to have connected these facts.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Head to the Fusion Core.|Fusion Core Entry]]
        </div> 
  <</ctp>>
</div>



