        You can simply call me the narrator. I'm a voice in your head — what else could I be? It feels like a befitting name
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [["What do you want me to do?"|Narrator What To Do]]
            [["Why can't you just open the door yourself?"|Narrator Why Not Open]]
