:: Specimen Bay Exit [nobr missing-features] {"position":"2200,1100","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "specimenBayExit">>
        <<speaker "Narrator">>
        You look like you just felt it again. It feels like a routine to you now.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        As you approach the exit, the Exception is standing in the doorway.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "You">>
        You scared the hell out of me!
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <<speaker "Exception">>
        Wasn't my intention. But I am here because you're here.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
